          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "套用此間距變更會重新啟動每個具有選單列項目的應用程式。重新啟動應用程式可能導致尚未儲存的輸入、進度或暫存狀態遺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applying this spacing change will relaunch each app with a menu bar item. Relaunching apps may cause unsaved input, progress, or transient app state to be lost. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile." : {
      "comment" : "Alert message variant shown when applying a spacing change for the active menu bar display while a profile is active. %@ is the active profile name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Po změně nastavení rozestupů se krátce restartují aplikace s položkami v řádku nabídek. Uložte nové nastavení rozložení pro aktivní profil „%@“, nebo pro všechny profily."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn diese Abstandsänderung angewendet wird, werden alle Anwendungen mit Menüleisten-Einträgen neu gestartet. Der Neustart von Anwendungen kann zu ungespeicherten Eingaben führen, der Fortschritt oder Zustand von Anwendungen kann verloren gehen. Die neuen Abstände können im aktiven Profil \"%@\" oder in allen Profilen gespeichert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al aplicar este cambio de espaciado, se reiniciarán momentáneamente todas las aplicaciones que tengan elementos en la barra de menús. Guarda el nuevo espaciado en el perfil activo %@ o guárdalo en todos los perfiles."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'enregistrement de cet espacement va brièvement relancer toutes les applications contenues dans la barre des menus. Enregistrer le nouvel espacement au profil actif \"%@\", ou le sauvegarder sur tous les profils."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ennek a térközváltozásnak az alkalmazása miden menüsávelemmel rendelkező alkalmazást újra fog indítani. Az alkalmazások újraindítása a nem mentett bemeneti adatok, a folyamatban lévő állapot vagy az átmeneti alkalmazásállapot elvesztését okozhatja. Mentse el az új térközt ehhez a profilhoz: \"%@\", vagy az összes profilhoz."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je deze wijziging in de spatiëring toepast, worden alle apps opnieuw gestart met een menubalkitem. Door het opnieuw starten van apps kunnen niet-opgeslagen invoer, voortgang of tijdelijke app-statussen verloren gaan. Sla de nieuwe spatiëring op in het actieve profiel “%@”, of sla deze op in alle profielen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zastosowanie tej zmiany odstępów spowoduje chwilowe ponowne uruchomienie wszystkich aplikacji z ikonami na pasku menu. Zapisz nowe ustawienie odstępów w aktywnym profilu \"%@\" lub we wszystkich profilach."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplicar essa mudança de espaçamento reiniciará brevemente todos os aplicativos com itens na barra de menus. Salve o novo espaçamento no perfil ativo \"%@\", ou salve em todos os perfis."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "การเปลี่ยนแปลงระยะห่างนี้จะทำให้แอปพลิเคชันทั้งหมดที่มีรายการในแถบเมนูเปิดใหม่ บันทึกระยะห่างใหม่ลงในโปรไฟล์ที่ใช้งานอยู่ \"%@\" หรือบันทึกไว้ในทุกโปรไฟล์"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu aralık değişikliği uygulandığında, menü çubuğu ögesi olan tüm uygulamalar kısaca yeniden başlatılacak. Yeni aralığı aktif profil \"%@\" için kaydet veya tüm profiller için kaydet."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applying this spacing change will briefly relaunch all apps with menu bar items. Save the new spacing to the active profile \"%@\", or save it to every profile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "套用此間距變更會重新啟動每個有選單列圖示的應用程式。重新啟動應用程式可能導致未儲存輸入、進度或暫存狀態遺失。請將新間距儲存至目前啟用的設定檔「%@」，或儲存至所有設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
