    "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results." : {
      "comment" : "Description for the Search section in the Advanced settings pane that controls which menu bar sections appear in the menu bar search panel and in what order.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyberte, které sekce řádku nabídek se objeví ve vyhledávacím panelu a v jakém pořadí. Pro uspořádání použijte tlačítka nahoru a dolů, vypnutím sekce ji vyloučíte z výsledků vyhledávání."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle, welche Menüleistensektionen in der Suchleiste auftauchen und in welcher Reihenfolge. Nutze die Knöpfe für hoch und runter zum Anordnen, und schalte eine Sektion aus, um ihre Einträge aus der Suche zu entfernen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige qué secciones de la barra de menús aparecen en el panel de búsqueda y en qué orden. Utiliza los botones de arriba y abajo para cambiar el orden, y desactiva una sección para excluir sus elementos de los resultados de búsqueda."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisissez les sections de la barre de menu qui apparaissent dans le panneau de recherche, et leur ordre d'affichage. Utilisez les flèches haut et bas pour les réorganiser, et désactivez une section pour exclure ses éléments des résultats de recherche."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pilih bagian bar menu yang ditampilkan di panel pencarian beserta urutannya. Gunakan tombol Naikkan dan Turunkan untuk mengatur ulang urutan, lalu nonaktifkan bagian untuk mengecualikan itemnya dari hasil pencarian."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kies welke onderdelen van de menubalk in het zoekvenster worden weergegeven en in welke volgorde. Gebruik de pijltjes omhoog en omlaag om de volgorde aan te passen, en schakel een onderdeel uit om de bijbehorende items uit de zoekresultaten te verwijderen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wybierz sekcje paska menu, które mają pojawiać się w panelu wyszukiwania, oraz ustal ich kolejność. Użyj przycisków w górę i w dół, aby zmienić kolejność, lub wyłącz daną sekcję, aby wykluczyć jej elementy z wyników wyszukiwania."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите, какие разделы строки меню будут отображаться на панели поиска и в каком порядке. Используйте кнопки вверх и вниз для изменения порядка, а также отключайте разделы, чтобы исключить их элементы из результатов поиска."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "เลือกว่าส่วนใดของแถบเมนูจะปรากฏในแผงค้นหา และลำดับที่จะแสดง ใช้ปุ่มขึ้นและลงเพื่อจัดเรียงใหม่ และปิดส่วนนั้นเพื่อไม่ให้รายการของส่วนนั้นปรากฏในผลการค้นหา"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arama panelinde hangi menü çubuğu bölümlerinin hangi sırayla görüneceğini seçin. Sıralamayı değiştirmek için yukarı ve aşağı butonlarını kullanın; bir bölümün ögelerini arama sonuçlarından hariç tutmak için ise o bölümü kapatın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Choose which menu bar sections appear in the search panel, and in what order. Use the up and down buttons to reorder, and turn off a section to exclude its items from search results."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chọn phần thanh menu nào xuất hiện trong bảng tìm kiếm và theo thứ tự. Sử dụng các nút lên và xuống để sắp xếp lại và tắt một phần để loại trừ các mục của nó khỏi kết quả tìm kiếm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择要在搜索面板中显示的菜单栏区域以及它们的显示顺序。使用上下键调整顺序，关闭某个部分即可将其中的项目从搜索结果中排除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇要在搜尋面板中顯示哪些選單列區段，以及顯示順序。使用上下按鈕重新排序，並關閉某個區段以將其項目排除在搜尋結果之外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
