    "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the menu bar appearance onboarding slide.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obarvěte řádek nabídek, jak se vám líbí. Vybírejte mezi jednolitými barvami, přechody a vlastními tvary, přidejte k nim stíny a ohraničení pro jedinečný výsledek."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gestalte Deine Menüleiste wie es Dir gefällt. Wähle Farben, Verläufe und benutzerdefinierte Formen, füge Schatten und Ränder für eine polierte Darstellung hinzu."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pintar tu barra de menús a tu manera. Elige colores lisos, degradados, y formas personalizadas, luego agrega sombras y bordes para un acabado pulido."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personnalisez votre barre de menu. Choisissez des couleurs unies, des dégradés et des formes personnalisées, puis ajoutez des ombres et des bordures pour une finition soignée."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personalisasikan tampilan bar menu. Pilih warna solid, gradiasi dan bentuk kustom, lalu tambahkan bayangan dan garis tepi untuk hasil yang lebih menarik."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geef je menubalk een eigen look. Kies effen kleuren, kleurverlopen en aangepaste vormen, en voeg vervolgens schaduwen en randen toe voor een strakke afwerking."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zaprojektuj pasek menu w swoim stylu. Dobierz pełne kolory, przejścia tonalne i unikalne kształty, a potem dodaj cienie oraz obramowania dla idealnego efektu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Раскрасьте строку меню на свой вкус. Выбирайте сплошные цвета, градиенты и произвольные формы, а затем добавляйте тени и границы для безупречного результата."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แต่งแถบเมนูตามสไตล์ของคุณ เลือกสีทึบ ไล่สี และรูปทรงที่กำหนดเอง จากนั้นเพิ่มเงาและเส้นขอบเพื่อความสวยงาม\n"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menü çubuğunuzu dilediğiniz gibi renklendirin. Düz renkler, gradyanlar ve özel şekiller seçin; ardından kusursuz bir görünüm için gölgeler ve kenarlıklar ekleyin."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Paint your menu bar your way. Choose solid colors, gradients, and custom shapes, then add shadows and borders for a polished finish."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vẽ thanh menu theo cách của bạn. Chọn màu đồng nhất, độ chuyển màu và hình dạng tùy chỉnh, sau đó thêm bóng và đường viền để có lớp hoàn thiện bóng bẩy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你的方式打造菜单栏。可选择纯色、渐变和自定义形状，再添加阴影和边框，呈现更加精致的效果。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以自己的風格定義選單列。您可選擇顏色與漸層色，並自定義形狀，再加上邊框與陰影使其更加好看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
