    "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Položky, které byly vyřazeny kvůli přeplnění řádku, najdete v liště Thaw. V řádku nabídek již není vedle výřezu volné místo, takže jejich zobrazení není možné ani rozšířením skryté části přímo v řádku. Tuto funkci deaktivujte, chcete-li vždy dodržovat nastavení lišty Thaw pro daný displej."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maak verborgen items zichtbaar via de Thaw Bar, terwijl bij een overloop items worden verwijderd. De zichtbare rij biedt op dat moment geen ruimte meer naast de inkeping, waardoor het uitvouwen van het verborgen gedeelte in de rij deze items niet kan weergeven. Schakel deze optie uit om altijd de instelling van de Thaw Bar per scherm te volgen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odsłoń ukryte elementy za pomocą paska Thaw, gdy przepełnienie powoduje ich wysunięcie. Widoczny wiersz nie ma już miejsca obok wycięcia, więc rozszerzenie ukrytej sekcji w linii nie może ich wyświetlić. Wyłącz, aby zawsze stosować ustawienie paska Thaw dla każdego wyświetlacza."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Показывать скрытые элементы через Thaw Bar, когда переполнение приводит к их исключению. В видимой строке в этот момент не остаётся места рядом с вырезом, поэтому раскрытие скрытого раздела в строке не позволяет их показать. Отключите, чтобы всегда использовать настройку Thaw Bar для каждого дисплея."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taşma nedeniyle ögeler dışarı atıldığında gizli ögeleri Thaw Çubuğu üzerinden gösterin. Görünür satırda çentiğin yanında yer kalmadığı için gizli bölümü satır içinde genişletmek bu ögeleri gösteremez. Ekran başına Thaw Çubuğu ayarını her zaman takip etmek için bunu devre dışı bırakın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Reveal hidden items through the Thaw Bar while overflow has items ejected. The visible row has no room left beside the notch at that point, so expanding the hidden section inline cannot show them. Disable to always follow the per-display Thaw Bar setting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当项目溢出时，使用 Thaw Bar 显示被隐藏的项目。此时刘海旁边的可见行已无多余空间，因此无法在行内展开隐藏区域以显示这些项目。停用此项将始终遵循每台显示器的 Thaw Bar 设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當項目溢出時，使用 Thaw Bar 顯示已隱藏的項目。此時瀏海旁的「顯示」列已無多餘空間，因此無法在列內展開隱藏區段來顯示這些項目。停用此選項將一律遵循每部監視器的 Thaw Bar 設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
