    "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing." : {
      "comment" : "Description of the hotkeys and automation onboarding slide.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spouštějte akce klávesami. Kombinujte časovače automatického skrytí a integraci s filtry režimů soustředění, Thaw s vámi vždy drží krok."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löse beliebige Aktionen mit einem Tastendruck aus. Verbinde automatisches Verstecken und mit der Fokusfilter-Integration, so dass sich Thaw anpasst, an was immer Du tust. "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ""
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Déclenchez n'importe quelle action d'une simple pression sur une touche. Combinez les minuteurs de masquage automatique et l'intégration du filtre Focus pour que Thaw s'adapte à toutes vos activités."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jalankan tindakan apapun dengan pintasan. Padukan pengatur waktu sembunyi otomatis dan integrasi Filter Fokus agar dapat menyesuaikan diri secara otomatis dengan aktivitas yang sedang dilakukan."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voer elke gewenste actie uit met een toetsaanslag. Combineer timers voor automatisch verbergen met de integratie van Focus Filter, zodat Thaw zich aanpast aan wat je op dat moment aan het doen bent."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wywołaj dowolną akcję naciśnięciem klawisza. Połącz timery automatycznego ukrywania z integracją z filtrami skupienia, aby Thaw dostosowywał się do tego, co akurat robisz."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Запускай действия с помощью сочетаний клавиш. Комбинируй таймеры скрытия элементов и фильтры, чтобы Thaw отображал именно то, что нужно сейчас."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "กดคีย์ลัดเพื่อเรียกใช้การกระทำใดก็ได้ ผสมตัวจับเวลาซ่อนอัตโนมัติและการเชื่อม Focus Filter เพื่อให้ Thaw ปรับตัวตามสิ่งที่คุณทำอยู่"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tek bir tuş vuruşuyla herhangi bir eylemi tetikleyin. Thaw uygulamasının yaptığınız her şeye uyum sağlaması için otomatik yeniden gizleme zamanlayıcılarını ve Odak Filtresi entegrasyonunu birleştirin."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Trigger any action with a keystroke. Combine auto-rehide timers and Focus Filter integration so Thaw adapts to whatever you're doing."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kích hoạt bất kỳ hành động nào bằng tổ hợp phím. Kết hợp tính năng tự động ẩn bộ hẹn giờ và tích hợp Bộ lọc tiêu điểm để điều chỉnh phù hợp với mọi việc bạn đang làm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过快捷键触发任意操作。结合自动重新隐藏计时器和专注模式过滤器集成，让 Thaw 能根据你的当前操作自动调整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用快速鍵觸發任何動作。結合自動重新隱藏計時器與專注模式過濾器整合，讓 Thaw 適應您正在進行的工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
